---
source: crates/assertrust/tests/cli.rs
expression: run.stdout
---
Catch changes that quietly weaken your test suite

Usage: assertrust <COMMAND>

Commands:
  check  Check a change for weakened tests
  ir     Print the tests and checks found in one file, as JSON (for debugging)
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
